 ### Does Tomli-W sort the document?<a name="does-tomli-w-sort-the-document"></a>
 
-Not by default: it respects sort order of the input data.
-Pass `sort_keys=True` to `dumps` or `dump` to write keys in sorted order
+Yes, by default (on this branch): keys are written in sorted order
 at every level, including inline tables.
+Pass `sort_keys=False` to `dumps` or `dump` to respect the order of the input data.
 Arrays keep their element order.
 
 ### Does Tomli-W support writing documents with comments?<a name="does-tomli-w-support-writing-documents-with-comments"></a>
